tasks
    T700
        title      Add reviewer skills and adapted Ponytail skills
        status     done
        priority   medium
        description
            Historical deliverable: add a contract-slice reviewer and a generic quality and
            bug-hunt reviewer, then adapt six attributed Ponytail skills for this repository.
            Historical reviewer-skill guidance followed the contracts and Bead scopes active
            at that time; required proof was retained and benchmark claims stayed upstream-only.
            No global config or lifecycle hooks were added.

            Source Bead: flow-state-e7p.7 (closed). Historical write scope:
            .agents/skills/flow-state-contract-slice-review,
            .agents/skills/performance-quality-bug-hunt, and six adapted skills under
            .agents/skills/ponytail/. Evidence: validator, forward-test, and whitespace
            receipts in the Bead closure record.
        acceptance
            All eight skills passed the official validator and focused whitespace checks.
            The reviewer skills and adapted Ponytail review passed realistic forward tests.
            Ponytail attribution and current benchmark framing were retained; no lifecycle
            hooks or global configuration were installed. AGENTS.md was unchanged.

            These are historical receipts only; they do not assert current skill behavior.
        derives_from [@plan.Verification.D6, @plan.Verification.V8]

